{"call": 13, "code": "import numpy as np\ndef equation(t, P, params):\n    a, b, d = params[0], params[1], params[2]\n    g = 1 - np.exp(-a * t**b)\n    u = t**d\n    c = [ 2.83228445e-01, -4.31790568e-02, -1.93094051e-01, -1.72711211e-03,\n          1.09368644e+01, -1.61740700e-01,  3.42224749e-02, -4.89957907e-02,\n          1.07719372e+00,  3.01100161e-01, -3.17496381e-02, -3.76402940e-03,\n         -1.03822428e+00, -2.27211307e-02,  8.54363781e-03,  4.75904693e-03]\n    T = [np.ones_like(t), g, u, g*u]\n    out = 0\n    idx = 0\n    for Tk in T:\n        for k in range(4):\n            out = out + c[idx] * Tk * P**k\n            idx += 1\n    return out\n", "train_nmse": 4.932892208629945e-07, "params": [0.1457992311018857, 1.336104571057342, 0.9654998893245167, 0.9838669920338967, 0.6061999537524648, 1.6499751665071332, 0.4672593396500395, 0.3459912447366805, 0.2741630279353783, 1.2372792259633352]}
